  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (RNA-only with PCA) achieves 0.4849 validation accuracy. This experiment tests whether changing the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a more complex model) improves performance while keeping other settings (singleprofile, no image modality, no aggregation) consistent. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, a critical design choice, and addresses uncertainty about whether more sophisticated encoders outperform simpler ones. It balances exploration (testing a new encoder) with exploitation (building on the baseline RNA-only setup)."
}

